        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-HARMONY-SN\"><b>Laurey Harmony Satin Nickel Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Harmony Satin Nickel Cabinet Pull has a sleek design that is just perfect for adding contemporary style to any kitchen remodel. The Satin Nickel Harmony Cabinet Pull is made by the Strategic Brands Laurey Line, which puts a focus on affordable cabinet hardware that has high style. The Laurey Harmony Satin Nickel Cabinet Pull is available in a wide array of sizes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Harmony Satin Nickel Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Nickel</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LAU-42028:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 2-1/2\" (64mm)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-42128:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-3/4\" (96mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-42228:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5\" (128mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-42328:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 6-1/4\" (160mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
